The  driver  supports  PCI  Ethernet adapters based on the NVIDIA
nForce Media and Communications Processors  (MCP),  such  as  the
nForce,  nForce  2,  nForce 3, CK804, MCP04, MCP51, MCP55, MCP61,
MCP65, MCP67 and MCP73 Ethernet  controller  chips.   The  driver
supports  the  following types: Enable autoselection of the media
type and options.  Set 10Mbps operation.  Set 100Mbps (Fast  Eth‐
ernet) operation.  Set 1000Mbps (Gigabit Ethernet) operation (re‐
cent  models  only).   The device driver first appeared in It was
